stepTitle="Uninstall FileAdmin"
helpText="""<strong>FileAdmin is about to be uninstalled.</strong><br><br>Choose whether to keep application data. This includes the SQLite database, configuration, secret, upload temp files and trash. External storage roots are never deleted."""
